<title>NEW ZEALAND: Wairarapa Electricity delists.</title>
<headline>Wairarapa Electricity delists.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-09-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Wairarapa Electricity Ltd has been delisted  following the virtual completion of the takeover by South Eastern Utilities Ltd , the New Zealand Stock Exchange said on Friday.</p>
<p>-- Wellington Newsroom (64-4-4734746)</p>
</text>
